<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport"
        content="width=device-width, user-scalable=no, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, minimum-scale=1.0">
  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="ie=edge">
  <title>Document</title>
</head>
<body>
Hello {{recipient}},
<br><br>
As a drafted mediator of <a
  href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">swap#{{orderId}}'s</a>
dispute#{{disputeId}},
we are letting you know that the dispute has entered <b>evidence submission
  phase</b>. During this phase, the
swap participants are expected to submit evidence to support or
reject the dispute creator's preferred outcome.
<br><br>
You are expected to carefully review the evidences and use our messaging
system to request for more evidences if required.
<br><br>
Evidence Phase Ends In: <b style="font-size:
22px; color: darkolivegreen;">{{evidencePhaseHoursLeft}}</b>
<br><br>
<h3 style="color: indianred">WARNING</h3>
<ul style="color: indianred">
  <li>Carefully review the evidences as voting the minority outcome will lead to
    your ticket getting slashed.
  </li>
</ul>
<br>
<ul>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">View Swap Order</a></li>
  <li><a href="https://app.fiatx.co/swap/{{orderId}}">How Disputes Work</a></li>
</ul>
<br>
{{app}}
</body>
</html>
